  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/610492/description_19c704fd-83da-48c6-93bc-c39ae13831db.png\" alt=\"Yet Another Furniture\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maQ6tE6Nsd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1378839788659933345?style=flat-square&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yet-another-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1209908?style=flat-square&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=CurseForge&color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyet-another-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/yet-another-furniture?style=flat-square&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth&color=00af5c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yet-another-furniture/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MC-1.20.1-6b6b88?style=flat-square&logo=minecraft&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Versions\"></a></p>\n<h3>⚠️ 注意：</h3>\n<p>本模组正在被<strong><em>彻底重构</em></strong>，并与“Building But Better”的重制版本合并。合并完成后，本模组将不再维护，但我将在 BBB 中加入相关功能以确保平滑过渡，避免方块消失。谢谢！</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>📋 简介</h3>\n<p><strong>Yet Another Furniture（又一件家具）</strong> 是一款家具模组，旨在作为 Another Furniture 的替代品，后者已将其整体概念和品牌完全确立。它是对我们原始模组的重新构想，带来了新功能、新方块以及全新的艺术风格。</p>\n<p>其中包含抽屉、沙发、灯具、橱柜等多种家具类型！</p>",
